# Build context of shelfy-egress.Dockerfile: BuildKit reads this file instead of
# a root .dockerignore. Only the Go sources of the port-allowlist wrapper go in;
# Smokescreen and the rest are fetched from go.sum inside the build.
*
!deploy
deploy/*
!deploy/docker
deploy/docker/*
!deploy/docker/shelfy-egress
**/.DS_Store
